creatures:
- name: Pirate
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 14  
      **Hit Points** 33 (rollable(dice=6d8 + 6,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Initiative) (15)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=8)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Gear** 6x dagger, leather armor  
      **Senses** Passive Perception 11  
      **Languages** Common plus one other language  
      **Challenge** 1 (200 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The pirate makes two Dagger attacks. It can replace one attack with a use of Enthralling Panache.

      ***Dagger.*** *Melee or Ranged Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=To Hit [Dagger]), reach 5 ft. or range 20/60 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d4+3,dicelabel=Damage [Dagger]) Piercing damage.

      ***Enthralling Panache.*** *Wisdom Saving Throw:* DC 12, one creature the pirate can see within 30 feet. *Failure:* The target has the ***Charmed*** condition until the start of the pirate's next turn.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
